  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Picture your website",
      "start": 0.12,
      "end": 1.38
    },
    {
      "text": "at two in the morning.",
      "start": 1.38,
      "end": 2.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Someone arrives",
      "start": 2.9,
      "end": 3.7
    },
    {
      "text": "with a question",
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 4.42
    },
    {
      "text": "they've never felt safe",
      "start": 4.42,
      "end": 5.7
    },
    {
      "text": "to ask out loud.",
      "start": 5.7,
      "end": 7.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Always be prepared",
      "start": 7.38,
      "end": 8.66
    },
    {
      "text": "to give an answer",
      "start": 8.66,
      "end": 9.62
    },
    {
      "text": "to everyone who asks you",
      "start": 9.62,
      "end": 11.22
    },
    {
      "text": "to give the reason",
      "start": 11.22,
      "end": 12.18
    },
    {
      "text": "for the hope",
      "start": 12.18,
      "end": 12.9
    },
    {
      "text": "that you have.",
      "start": 12.9,
      "end": 14.1
    },
    {
      "text": "The questions never stop.",
      "start": 14.5,
      "end": 16.58
    },
    {
      "text": "But your team",
      "start": 16.58,
      "end": 17.3
    },
    {
      "text": "can't answer them all.",
      "start": 17.3,
      "end": 18.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Generic AI hedges,",
      "start": 18.79,
      "end": 20.47
    },
    {
      "text": "misquotes Scripture,",
      "start": 20.47,
      "end": 21.83
    },
    {
      "text": "or quietly contradicts",
      "start": 21.83,
      "end": 23.51
    },
    {
      "text": "what you teach.",
      "start": 23.51,
      "end": 24.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Apologist AI puts",
      "start": 24.79,
      "end": 26.39
    },
    {
      "text": "a faithful, branded",
      "start": 26.39,
      "end": 27.67
    },
    {
      "text": "chatbot on your",
      "start": 27.67,
      "end": 28.55
    },
    {
      "text": "ministry's website.",
      "start": 28.55,
      "end": 29.83
    },
    {
      "text": "It answers from",
      "start": 29.83,
      "end": 30.71
    },
    {
      "text": "your own teaching,",
      "start": 30.71,
      "end": 31.83
    },
    {
      "text": "any hour, in any language,",
      "start": 31.83,
      "end": 33.67
    },
    {
      "text": "and cites its sources.",
      "start": 33.67,
      "end": 35.42
    },
    {
      "text": "When someone needs",
      "start": 35.51,
      "end": 36.47
    },
    {
      "text": "a real person,",
      "start": 36.47,
      "end": 37.81
    },
    {
      "text": "it passes them",
      "start": 37.81,
      "end": 38.53
    },
    {
      "text": "to your team.",
      "start": 38.53,
      "end": 39.76
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the number one",
      "start": 40.37,
      "end": 41.49
    },
    {
      "text": "Christian AI platform on",
      "start": 41.49,
      "end": 43.01
    },
    {
      "text": "The Gospel Coalition's",
      "start": 43.01,
      "end": 44.93
    },
    {
      "text": "2026 AI Christian Benchmark.",
      "start": 44.93,
      "end": 47.01
    },
    {
      "text": "It's trusted by Got Questions,",
      "start": 47.01,
      "end": 48.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Apologetics Canada,",
      "start": 48.77,
      "end": 50.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Dare to Share,",
      "start": 50.05,
      "end": 51.09
    },
    {
      "text": "and more.",
      "start": 51.09,
      "end": 51.97
    },
    {
      "text": "We run your",
      "start": 52.37,
      "end": 53.17
    },
    {
      "text": "AI infrastructure,",
      "start": 53.17,
      "end": 54.53
    },
    {
      "text": "so you can focus",
      "start": 54.53,
      "end": 55.57
    },
    {
      "text": "on the people you serve.",
      "start": 55.57,
      "end": 57.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mission.",
      "start": 57.28,
      "end": 58.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Our platform.",
      "start": 58.4,
      "end": 59.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Christ made known.",
      "start": 59.68,
      "end": 61.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Book a quick intro call,",
